# React frontend

- Feature code lives in `src/features`. One query hook per resource. No `any`.
- Search, sort, and page stay in the router search params.
- Map 422 `errors` onto form fields. Offer retry after a network failure.
- Import motion from `motion/react`. Animate `transform` and `opacity` only.
- Call `useReducedMotion` in every animated component.
- Scroll-linked and CSS 3D effects live in `src/features/landing` and load only with the lazy `/welcome` route.
- Dashboard motion stays under 200ms and does not bind to scroll.
